Size-2 closed form (DR): E({x,y}) = sum_{i: x_i != y_i} w_i, split into
singletons gains all of it; density = (diff weight)/(2d) <= 1/2 with equality
iff x,y differ in all n coordinates, i.e. antipodal. EC above confirms.
